sequenceDiagram
    participant User as kubectl
    participant API as kube-apiserver
    participant Auth as AuthN / AuthZ
    participant Admission as Admission
    participant Store as etcd
    participant Controller as Controllers
    participant Scheduler as Scheduler
    participant Kubelet as kubelet
    participant Runtime as Container runtime

    User->>API: Submit manifest over HTTPS
    API->>Auth: Authenticate and authorize
    Auth-->>API: Identity and decision
    API->>Admission: Mutate / validate
    Admission-->>API: Accept or reject
    API->>Store: Persist accepted object
    Store-->>API: Commit
    API-->>User: API response
    API-->>Controller: Watch event
    Controller->>API: Reconcile dependent objects
    API-->>Scheduler: Unscheduled Pod
    Scheduler->>API: Bind Pod to node
    API-->>Kubelet: Pod assignment observed
    Kubelet->>Runtime: Create Pod containers
    Runtime-->>Kubelet: Runtime state
    Kubelet->>API: Report Pod status
